\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces ISR$^*$ (proved samples only) training trajectories across reward conditions (rolling $w{=}20$). Exec-only collapses to $\text  {ISR}{\approx }0$, confirming structural degeneration (\S  \ref {sec:diagnostic}); the ${\sim }0.5$ plateau is an $n{=}2$ artifact. ISR $\beta {=}0.1$ seeds rise toward $\text  {ISR}{\approx }1$ via TS gaming (Goodhart effect, \S  \ref {sec:goodhart}); random remains low.}}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
