\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Detailed per-seed results: FOL (Prover9). Includes the per-seed $\beta {=}0.1$ breakdown referenced from Table~\ref {tab:goodhart-landscape}. PR = prove rate, ISR$^*$ = proved-only ISR, TS/CE/N-H\ = percentage among proved samples. ``---'' indicates data not available. $^\dagger $s43 uses sampling eval ($T{=}0.7$). $^\ddagger $Three s44-1000 samples escape text-match heuristics (CE/PG classifiers) but exhibit ISR${=}0$ and functionally degenerate proof structures: disjunctive conclusions that bypass PG detection and commuted premises that bypass CE detection; reclassified as degenerate. $^\diamond $Seeds 45--46 added post-hoc under identical hyperparameters (effective batch size 8; micro-batch decomposition differs: $4{\times }2$ vs.\ $2{\times }4$, mathematically equivalent).}}{19}{table.caption.78}\protected@file@percent }
